{# Training Metrics, on Training Tools (since 2026-10-27; was on Race
   Tools; the Your Swim calculator it held moved to Calculators 2026-10-25):
   your logged training. Workout Generator on light blue, then Training
   Summary and Training Effect from your log, then the training links
   (Workout Library, Training Plans; Send to Strava was removed 2026-10-28),
   on white. Members log swims; anyone else sees what members get
   (race-tools.js). #}
<div class="swim-panel swim-training" id="your-training">
  <div class="swim-panel__band swim-panel__band--blue swim-training__band">
    <p class="swim-training__lead" data-members-only>Build a workout and log it to see your training here.</p>
    <p class="swim-training__lead" data-non-members-only hidden>Members log their swims and see their training: weekly yards, a training status and what each swim does for their fitness.</p>
    <div class="swim-training__actions">
      {# Its Add to Log button was removed 2026-10-28; Training Effect's lock
         still opens the form #}
      <a href="/fitness-and-training/workout-generator/" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm" data-members-only>Workout Generator</a>
      <a href="/join-usms/membership-comparison.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" data-non-members-only hidden>Join U.S. Masters Swimming</a>
    </div>
    <p class="swim-card__sub swim-training__status" data-st="logStatus" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
  <div class="swim-panel__band">
    <div class="swim-deck__grid swim-deck__grid--8-4 swim-training__grid" data-members-only>
      <div class="swim-deck__cell">{% include "partials/RaceTools/TrainingSummary.njk" %}</div>
      <div class="swim-deck__cell">{% include "partials/RaceTools/TrainingEffect.njk" %}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="swim-deck__kpis">
      {# Workout Library: what it offers, then a button: members browse it,
         anyone else joins first (race-tools.js). Browse opens Build a
         Workout (the Swim Tools app, race-tools/workouts/) until the
         app's Workout Library view exists. #}
      <div class="swim-kpi swim-kpi--action">
        <span class="swim-kpi__label"><span class="swim-kpi__icon--library" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></span>Workout Library</span>
        <ul class="swim-kpi__list">
          <li>Workouts from Masters coaches</li>
          <li>Search by stroke and distance</li>
          <li>Sets for every level</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/fitness-and-training/workout-generator/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm swim-kpi__action swim-kpi__action--browse" data-members-only>Browse</a>
        <a href="/join-usms/membership-comparison.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm swim-kpi__action" data-non-members-only hidden>Join USMS</a>
      </div>
      {# Training Plans: leads to the Swim Tools app's Training Plans view.
         Not built yet: #0. #}
      <div class="swim-kpi swim-kpi--action">
        <span class="swim-kpi__label"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-simple swim-kpi__icon--workout" aria-hidden="true"></i>Training Plans</span>
        <span class="swim-kpi__sub" data-members-only>Build a training plan toward your race goal.</span>
        <span class="swim-kpi__sub" data-non-members-only hidden>Members can build a custom plan from our Workout Library.</span>
        <a href="#0" class="swim-kpi__add" data-members-only>Create a plan</a>
        <a href="/join-usms/membership-comparison.html" class="swim-kpi__add" data-non-members-only hidden aria-label="Create a plan: join USMS to create plans">Create a plan</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
